          "_name": "news03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"news03\" group=\"News\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked=\"\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Event Name\" name=\"showTitle\" checked=\"\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Date\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked=\"\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#faf6ee\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n      <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>✨WHY CHOOSE PRAVEEN WORLD?</b></h2>\n      <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\n      </h5>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center \">\n      <div class=\" col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 mb-5\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>A Personalised Approach to Understanding Yourself.</b></h3>\n            <h4 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">- Integrated approach combining different areas of expertise.\n<div>- Strong focus on NLP and Subconscious Mind Coaching.\n</div><div>- Hypnotherapy and emotional wellness approaches.\n</div><div>- Traditional Javanese knowledge and practices.\n</div><div>- Complementary energy and spiritual wellness.\n</div><div>- Individual-focused guidance.\n</div><div>- Online sessions worldwide.\n</div><div>- In-person sessions in Moradabad, India.</div></h4>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Our focus is to help you explore your needs and identify an approach that aligns with your personal goals.<br>\n<br>Your journey is unique. Your approach should be too.<br></p>\n            <div mbr-buttons=\"\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n              <a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                Learn more</a>\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
