          "_name": "article08",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article8\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Content Width\" name=\"contentWidth\" min=\"8\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Image\" name=\"showImage\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#faf6ee\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.3\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"card col-md-12 col-lg-{{contentWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"image-wrapper d-flex justify-content-center mb-4\">\n            <img mbr-if=\"showImage\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/golden-path-to-holistic-wellness-coaching.png\" alt=\"Who Can Explore This Coaching?\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card-content-text\">\n            <h3 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white mt-3 mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b>Personal Growth Begins With Self-Understanding.</b></h3>\n          <div class=\"row card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Corporate Professionals</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Explore workplace responses, confidence, communication and professional development.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Entrepreneurs &amp; Business Owners</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Explore beliefs, decision-making patterns, self-doubt and goal clarity.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Students &amp; Young Adults</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Explore self-awareness, confidence, motivation and personal development.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Investors &amp; Traders</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Explore emotional awareness, patience, discipline and decision-making habits. This is not financial or investment advice.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><p><b>Anyone Interested in Personal Growth</b></p></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">For individuals who want to understand their habits, beliefs and personal patterns more deeply.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n\n            <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">EXPLORE HOW WE WORK</a></div>\n          </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "article08-a1",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vBoStUE9XG",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)",
              "& when (@overlay)": {
                ".mbr-overlay": {
                  "background": "@overlayColor",
                  "opacity": "@overlayOpacity"
                }
              }
            },
            "img, .item-img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "& when (@autoSize)": {
                "height": "100%",
                "object-fit": "cover",
                "& when (@showCardTitle)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                },
                "& when (@showText)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                },
                "& when (@showButtons)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                }
              }
            },
            ".item:focus, span:focus": {
              "outline": "none"
            },
            ".item": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".item": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "& when not (@spacing)": {
              ".row": {
                "margin-left": "0",
                "margin-right": "0"
              },
              ".item": {
                "padding": "0",
                "margin": "0"
              }
            },
            ".item-content": {
              "margin-top": "2rem",
              "padding": "0 2.25rem 2.25rem",
              "@media (min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1200px)": {
                "padding": "0 1.5rem 1.5rem",
                "padding-top": "1rem",
                "margin-top": "1rem"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem",
                "padding-top": "1rem",
                "margin-top": "1rem"
              },
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-direction": "column",
              "height": "100%"
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "position": "relative",
              "background": "@cardsBg",
              "height": "100%",
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-flow": "column nowrap",
              ".item-footer": {
                "margin-top": "auto"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#1f2a5c"
            },
            ".item-title": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#1f2a5c"
            },
            ".item-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#1e1e2b"
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle, .mbr-section-head .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#1e1e2b"
            }
          },
          "_name": "features04",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features4 start\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"12\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\" selected=\"\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">4</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showmainButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n\t\t<header>Cards</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"autoSize &amp;&amp; !(showButtons==false &amp;&amp; showCardSubtitle==false &amp;&amp; showCardTitle==false &amp;&amp; showText==false)\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" name=\"cardsBg\" title=\"BG\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" parallax=\"\" name=\"bg\" required=\"\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#faf6ee\" selected=\"\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type == 'image'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type == 'image'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle || showmainButton\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>Online &amp; In-Person Sessions</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .mbr-section-head .mbr-section-btn\">Connect With Praveen World From Wherever You Are</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center item-footer mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showmainButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons=\"\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get Started</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/worldwide-online-coaching-sessions.png\" alt=\"Online Sessions Worldwide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Online Sessions Worldwide</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">Connect with Praveen World from anywhere in India or worldwide through online sessions.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons=\"\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/rzp/YZQ6QlB\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">🔘BOOK A SESSION</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/in-person-coaching-session-poster.png\" alt=\"In-Person Sessions\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>In-Person Sessions</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMeet in person in Moradabad, Uttar Pradesh, India, by prior appointment.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons=\"\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/rzp/YZQ6QlB\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">🔘BOOK A SESSION</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "features04-bs",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vBqgM343IC",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#1e1e2b"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#1f2a5c",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#1e1e2b"
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "background": "@cardbg",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "padding": "2.25rem",
              "@media (min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1200px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem",
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem",
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-card-title": {
              "color": "#1f2a5c"
            }
          },
          "_name": "list05",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list05\" group=\"List\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Question\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#faf6ee\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>❓FAQ – Frequently Asked Questions&nbsp;</b></h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Have questions about Praveen World? Find answers to help you understand our services and approach.</h5>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center \">\n            <div class=\" col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>1. What is Subconscious Mind Coaching?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            It is a coaching approach that explores learned beliefs, habitual responses and patterns that may influence everyday experiences.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>2. How does the subconscious mind influence daily life?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            Learned associations and automatic responses can influence how we interpret situations, form habits and react to familiar experiences.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>3. Is Subconscious Mind Coaching the same as NLP?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            No. They are related approaches, but their focus can differ. NLP explores language, thought patterns and behaviour, while Subconscious Mind Coaching focuses on learned beliefs and habitual responses.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>4. Can this coaching help me understand recurring habits?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            Exploring recurring habits and responses can be part of the coaching process. Individual experiences vary.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>5. Are online sessions available?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            Yes. Online sessions are available through suitable online arrangements, allowing people to connect with Praveen World from different locations.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>6. How many sessions are required?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            This depends on your goals, preferences and individual requirements. There is no fixed number for everyone.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>7. Is this a medical or psychological treatment?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            No. Subconscious Mind Coaching is a personal-development service, not a substitute for medical diagnosis, psychotherapy or mental healthcare.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>8. Are results guaranteed?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            No. Individual experiences and progress vary. No specific outcome is guaranteed.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
