          "_name": "list05",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list05\" group=\"List\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Question\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#faf6ee\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>❓FAQ – Frequently Asked Questions&nbsp;</b></h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Have questions about Praveen World? Find answers to help you understand our services and approach.</h5>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center \">\n            <div class=\" col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>1. What is mindset coaching for corporate professionals?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">It is a personal-development approach that helps professionals explore their thinking patterns, beliefs, confidence, communication and personal goals.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>2. Can NLP Coaching help me improve my confidence?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">NLP Coaching can provide opportunities to explore self-beliefs, communication patterns and personal strategies related to confidence. Individual experiences vary.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>3. Can coaching help with workplace stress?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Coaching can help you reflect on your responses, priorities and personal strategies. It is not a substitute for professional mental health treatment.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>4. Do I need to leave my job to attend coaching?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">No. Online sessions can be scheduled by mutual agreement around your availability.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>5. Are sessions available online?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Yes. Online coaching sessions are available across India and may also be arranged internationally, subject to scheduling.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>6. How many sessions will I need?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">There is no fixed number. The number of sessions depends on your goals, preferences and individual progress.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>7. Is coaching confidential?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Your personal discussions should be handled respectfully and with appropriate privacy. Confidentiality arrangements and their limits can be discussed before beginning.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>8. Are career growth or promotion results guaranteed?</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">No. Coaching does not guarantee promotion, salary increases or career success. It focuses on personal awareness, reflection and development.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vBvaEN1usm",
          "_anchor": "list05-ea",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
