          "_name": "news04",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"news04\" group=\"News\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Event Name\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Date\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#faf6ee\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n      <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>Do You Feel Stuck in Patterns You Want to Change?</b></h3>\n      <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Sometimes, you may understand what you want to change, but taking the next step feels difficult.</h5>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center \">\n      <div class=\" col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>You may experience:</b></h5>\n            <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              May 17-18, 2025\n            </h6>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">- Repeated habits that are difficult to change.<br>- Self-doubt while making important decisions.<br>- Fear or hesitation when moving forward.<br>- Difficulty maintaining focus on personal goals.<br>- A desire to build confidence and a positive mindset.<br>- Curiosity about your thoughts and inner experiences.<br><br>You don't have to figure everything out at once. The first step is understanding yourself better.</p>\n            <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                EXPLORE NLP &amp; SUBCONSCIOUS MIND COACHING</a></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "news04-ap",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vBpgh0ajQy",
