          "_name": "article08",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article8\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Content Width\" name=\"contentWidth\" min=\"8\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Image\" name=\"showImage\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#faf6ee\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.3\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"card col-md-12 col-lg-{{contentWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"image-wrapper d-flex justify-content-center mb-4\">\n            <img mbr-if=\"showImage\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/what-is-hypnotherapy-a-guided-journey.png\" alt=\"What Is Hypnotherapy\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card-content-text\">\n            <h3 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white mt-3 mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b>Understanding Hypnotherapy</b></h3>\n          <div class=\"row card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>At Praveen World, Coach Praveen Singh offers guided hypnotherapy sessions online worldwide and in-person in Moradabad, India, providing a supportive and respectful space for self-exploration and personal development.</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Hypnotherapy is a guided process that may involve focused attention, relaxation, imagination and therapeutic suggestions.<br><br>During a session, a practitioner may guide you towards a relaxed and focused state in which you can explore thoughts, feelings and personal experiences.<br><br>Hypnosis is not sleep or mind control. You remain a participant in the process and can communicate, respond or stop whenever you wish.<br><br>At Praveen World, hypnotherapy is approached with respect, comfort and individual consent.<br><b><br>What to understand about hypnotherapy:<br></b>- It is a guided process, not mind control.<br>- You remain involved and can communicate during the session.<br>- You are not required to accept suggestions that feel uncomfortable.<br>- Each person's experience may be different.<br>- It does not guarantee a particular result.<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n\n            <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">EXPLORE HOW WE WORK</a></div>\n          </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_anchor": "article08-ao",
          "_cid": "vBpenAp7Hc",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "features20",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".item": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (min-width: 991px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "4rem"
              },
              "&:last-child": {
                ".icon-box": {
                  "&:before": {
                    "display": "none"
                  }
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showCardText)": {
                "& when (@showCardTitle)": {
                  "margin-bottom": "4rem"
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showCardTitle)": {
                "& when (@showCardText)": {
                  "margin-bottom": "4rem"
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showArrows)": {
                "align-items": "flex-start"
              },
              "&.last": {
                ".icon-box": {
                  "&:before": {
                    "display": "none"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".icon-box": {
              "background": "@iconColor",
              "width": "60px",
              "min-width": "60px",
              "height": "60px",
              "border-radius": "50%",
              "margin-right": "2rem",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "align-items": "center",
              "position": "relative",
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "margin-right": "1rem"
              },
              "& when (@showArrows)": {
                "&::before": {
                  "content": "\"\\e925\"",
                  "font-family": "Moririse2 !important",
                  "position": "absolute",
                  "font-size": "~\"@{arrowsSize}px\"",
                  "left": "50%",
                  "top": "~\"@{arrowsTop}%\"",
                  "& when (@fullWidth)": {
                    "top": "100%"
                  },
                  "color": "@iconColor",
                  "transform": "translate(-50%, 0)"
                }
              }
            },
            "span": {
              "font-size": "2rem",
              "color": "contrast(@iconColor, darken(@iconColor, 50%), #ffffff, 60%)"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".card": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              },
              ".card-wrapper": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              },
              ".icon-box": {
                "& when (@showArrows)": {
                  "&::before": {
                    "top": "141%",
                    "& when (@fullWidth)": {
                      "top": "123%"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
              ".icon-box": {
                "& when (@showArrows)": {
                  "&::before": {
                    "top": "114%"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".card-title, .card-box": {
              "color": "#1f2a5c"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#1e1e2b"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features20\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"7\" max=\"12\" value=\"9\" step=\"1\">\n        <select title=\"Steps\" name=\"steps\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\" selected>5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n            <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n            <option value=\"8\">8</option>\n            <option value=\"9\">9</option>\n            <option value=\"10\">10</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButton\">\n        <header>Step</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showCardText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#6592e6\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Arrows\" name=\"showArrows\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#6592e6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Arrows Size\" name=\"arrowsSize\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"43\" condition=\"showArrows\">\n            <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Arrows Top\" name=\"arrowsTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"150\" step=\"1\" value=\"120\" condition=\"showArrows\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#faf6ee\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButton\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper pb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b>How Does a Hypnotherapy Session Work?</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">A Guided Experience, Step by Step<br></p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-if=\"showButton\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Create\n                                your own site</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{textWidth-1}}\">\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 1}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">1</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Initial Conversation</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-size: 1.2rem;\">Discuss what you would like to explore and understand your expectations.</span><br></div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 2}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">2</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Comfort &amp; Preparation</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-size: 1.2rem;\">Understand the process, ask questions and make sure you feel comfortable before proceeding.</span><br></div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 3}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">3</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Guided Relaxation</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-size: 1.2rem;\">Experience a guided process involving focused attention and relaxation.</span><br></div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 3\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 4}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">4</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Exploration &amp; Suggestions</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div>Explore relevant thoughts and responses through appropriate guided suggestions.</div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 4\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 5}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">5</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Reflection</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-size: 1.2rem;\">Discuss your experience and consider practical ways to apply your insights in everyday life.</span><br></div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 5\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 6}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">6</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>INTEGRATE</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Apply your learning in everyday life.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 6\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 7}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">7</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Specification</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Mobirise is perfect for non-techies who\n                            are not familiar with\n                            the intricacies of web development.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 7\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 8}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">8</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Project Planning</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Mobirise is perfect for non-techies who\n                            are not familiar with\n                            the intricacies of web development.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 8\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 9}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">9</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Deployment</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Mobirise is perfect for non-techies who\n                            are not familiar with\n                            the intricacies of web development.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 9\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 10}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">10</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Deployment</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Mobirise is perfect for non-techies who\n                            are not familiar with\n                            the intricacies of web development.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vBpbahAP9m",
          "_anchor": "features20-ah",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)",
              "& when (@overlay)": {
                ".mbr-overlay": {
                  "background": "@overlayColor",
                  "opacity": "@overlayOpacity"
                }
              }
            },
            "img, .item-img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "& when (@autoSize)": {
                "height": "100%",
                "object-fit": "cover",
                "& when (@showCardTitle)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                },
                "& when (@showText)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                },
                "& when (@showButtons)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                }
              }
            },
            ".item:focus, span:focus": {
              "outline": "none"
            },
            ".item": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "& when not (@spacing)": {
              ".row": {
                "margin-left": "0",
                "margin-right": "0"
              },
              ".item": {
                "padding": "0",
                "margin": "0"
              }
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "position": "relative",
              "background": "@cardsBg",
              "height": "100%",
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-flow": "column nowrap",
              ".item-content": {
                "display": "flex",
                "flex-direction": "column",
                "height": "100%"
              },
              ".item-footer": {
                "margin-top": "auto"
              },
              "& when (@showButtons)": {
                ".item-content": {
                  "padding": "2.25rem 2.25rem 0"
                },
                ".item-footer": {
                  "padding-bottom": "2rem"
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showButtons)": {
                ".item-content": {
                  "padding": "2.25rem"
                }
              },
              "@media (min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1200px)": {
                "& when (@showButtons)": {
                  ".item-content": {
                    "padding": "1.5rem 1.5rem 0"
                  },
                  ".item-footer": {
                    "padding-bottom": "1.5rem"
                  }
                },
                "& when not (@showButtons)": {
                  ".item-content": {
                    "padding": "1.5rem"
                  }
                }
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "& when (@showButtons)": {
                  ".item-content": {
                    "padding": "1.5rem 1.5rem 0"
                  },
                  ".item-footer": {
                    "padding-bottom": "1.25rem"
                  }
                },
                "& when not (@showButtons)": {
                  ".item-content": {
                    "padding": "1.5rem"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#232323"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".item-title": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#1f2a5c"
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .item-wrapper .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-head .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#1f2a5c"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle, .mbr-section-head .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#1e1e2b"
            }
          },
          "_name": "features06",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features6 start\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"12\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">4</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showmainButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n\t\t<header>Cards</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"autoSize && !(showButtons==false &&  showCardTitle==false && showText==false)\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" name=\"cardsBg\" title=\"Cards BG\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\" required>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#faf6ee\" selected>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-head .mbr-section-btn\"><b>What Can You Explore Through Hypnotherapy?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .mbr-section-head .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Explore Areas of Personal Development</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showmainButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-secondary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/confidence-at-sunrise.png\" alt=\"Confidence\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Confidence</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item-wrapper .mbr-section-btn\">Explore thoughts and beliefs connected with self-confidence and self-expression.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/habits-and-behaviour-a-path-to-positive-change.png\" alt=\"Habits & Behaviour\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Habits &amp; Behaviour</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item-wrapper .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReflect on recurring habits and explore healthier choices.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/focus-and-clarity-infographic.png\" alt=\"Focus & Clarity\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Focus &amp; Clarity</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item-wrapper .mbr-section-btn\">Develop greater awareness of your goals, priorities and intentions.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/self-belief-rise-beyond-limits.png\" alt=\"Self-Belief\" data-slide-to=\"3\" data-bs-slide-to=\"4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Self-Belief</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item-wrapper .mbr-section-btn\">Explore the beliefs that influence how you see yourself and your abilities.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/personal-growth-journey-infographic.png\" alt=\"Personal Growth\" data-slide-to=\"4\" data-bs-slide-to=\"5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Personal Growth</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item-wrapper .mbr-section-btn\">Create space for reflection, self-understanding and positive personal development.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/relaxation-and-self-awareness-infographic.png\" alt=\"Relaxation & Self-Awareness\" data-slide-to=\"5\" data-bs-slide-to=\"6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Relaxation &amp; Self-Awareness</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item-wrapper .mbr-section-btn\">Experience guided relaxation and become more aware of your inner experiences.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vBpbah8RY6",
          "_anchor": "features06-ag",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "features20",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".item": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (min-width: 991px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "4rem"
              },
              "&:last-child": {
                ".icon-box": {
                  "&:before": {
                    "display": "none"
                  }
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showCardText)": {
                "& when (@showCardTitle)": {
                  "margin-bottom": "4rem"
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showCardTitle)": {
                "& when (@showCardText)": {
                  "margin-bottom": "4rem"
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showArrows)": {
                "align-items": "flex-start"
              },
              "&.last": {
                ".icon-box": {
                  "&:before": {
                    "display": "none"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".icon-box": {
              "background": "@iconColor",
              "width": "60px",
              "min-width": "60px",
              "height": "60px",
              "border-radius": "50%",
              "margin-right": "2rem",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "align-items": "center",
              "position": "relative",
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "margin-right": "1rem"
              },
              "& when (@showArrows)": {
                "&::before": {
                  "content": "\"\\e925\"",
                  "font-family": "Moririse2 !important",
                  "position": "absolute",
                  "font-size": "~\"@{arrowsSize}px\"",
                  "left": "50%",
                  "top": "~\"@{arrowsTop}%\"",
                  "& when (@fullWidth)": {
                    "top": "100%"
                  },
                  "color": "@iconColor",
                  "transform": "translate(-50%, 0)"
                }
              }
            },
            "span": {
              "font-size": "2rem",
              "color": "contrast(@iconColor, darken(@iconColor, 50%), #ffffff, 60%)"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".card": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              },
              ".card-wrapper": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              },
              ".icon-box": {
                "& when (@showArrows)": {
                  "&::before": {
                    "top": "141%",
                    "& when (@fullWidth)": {
                      "top": "123%"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
              ".icon-box": {
                "& when (@showArrows)": {
                  "&::before": {
                    "top": "114%"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".card-title, .card-box": {
              "color": "#1f2a5c"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#1e1e2b"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features20\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"7\" max=\"12\" value=\"9\" step=\"1\">\n        <select title=\"Steps\" name=\"steps\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\" selected>5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n            <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n            <option value=\"8\">8</option>\n            <option value=\"9\">9</option>\n            <option value=\"10\">10</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButton\">\n        <header>Step</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showCardText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#6592e6\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Arrows\" name=\"showArrows\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#6592e6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Arrows Size\" name=\"arrowsSize\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"43\" condition=\"showArrows\">\n            <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Arrows Top\" name=\"arrowsTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"150\" step=\"1\" value=\"120\" condition=\"showArrows\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#faf6ee\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButton\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper pb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b>The Praveen World Hypnotherapy Approach</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>\n                            A Guided Process at Your Own Pace</b></p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-if=\"showButton\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Create\n                                your own site</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{textWidth-1}}\">\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 1}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">1</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Understand</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-size: 1.2rem;\">We begin with a conversation about your goals, expectations and concerns.</span><br></div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 2}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">2</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Prepare</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-size: 1.2rem;\">We discuss the process, answer your questions and ensure you feel comfortable and informed.</span><br></div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 3}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">3</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Guided Experience</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-size: 1.2rem;\">A guided process may involve focused attention, relaxation, imagery and suggestions, depending on your needs and consent.</span><br></div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 3\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 4}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">4</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Reflection</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-size: 1.2rem;\">You have an opportunity to reflect on your experience and share your thoughts.</span><br></div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 4\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 5}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">5</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Next Steps</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div>We discuss practical ways to continue your personal development journey.</div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 5\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 6}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">6</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>INTEGRATE</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Apply your learning in everyday life.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 6\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 7}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">7</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Specification</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Mobirise is perfect for non-techies who\n                            are not familiar with\n                            the intricacies of web development.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 7\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 8}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">8</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Project Planning</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Mobirise is perfect for non-techies who\n                            are not familiar with\n                            the intricacies of web development.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 8\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 9}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">9</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Deployment</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Mobirise is perfect for non-techies who\n                            are not familiar with\n                            the intricacies of web development.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 9\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 10}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">10</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Deployment</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Mobirise is perfect for non-techies who\n                            are not familiar with\n                            the intricacies of web development.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
