          "_name": "article08",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article8\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Content Width\" name=\"contentWidth\" min=\"8\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Image\" name=\"showImage\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.3\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"card col-md-12 col-lg-{{contentWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"image-wrapper d-flex justify-content-center mb-4\">\n            <img mbr-if=\"showImage\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/img-20260214.png\" alt=\"PRAVEEN WORLD\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card-content-text\">\n            <h3 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white mt-3 mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b>🌍 Meet Praveen Singh – Founder &amp; CEO, PRAVEEN WORLD</b></h3>\n          <div class=\"row card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div><b>NLP &amp; Subconscious Mind Coach • Author • Speaker • Personal Development &amp; Holistic Wellness Coach</b></div></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">My work brings together different approaches to help people explore the <b>subconscious&nbsp;mind,&nbsp; patterns, emotions, behaviour, presence and holistic wellbeing.</b><br><br>At Praveen World, I work with individuals, professionals, entrepreneurs, students and organizations through <b>NLP • Hypnotherapy • Javanese Magnetism • Mesmerism • Energy Healing • Emotional Release • Holistic Wellness • Personal Development</b><br><br>My intention is simple:<br><b>Work with the mind. Understand the emotions. Reconnect with yourself.<br></b></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>🔹 MY JOURNEY — FROM TECHNOLOGY TO HUMAN POTENTIAL</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">I started my professional journey in the IT world with a Bachelor's Degree in Information Technology and a Master's Degree in Philosophy.<br><br>My early professional experience gave me the opportunity to work with people, teams, leadership and professional development.<br><br>By 2008, I was leading a team of over 5,000 professionals.<br><br>But as my professional journey continued, another question became increasingly important to me:<br><br><b>Why do people sometimes know what they want to change, yet continue returning to the same patterns?</b><br><br>The more I explored this question, the more interested I became in the relationship between <b>thoughts, language, behaviour, emotions, beliefs and subconscious processes.</b><br><br>That exploration eventually led me toward NLP, personal development and holistic approaches to wellbeing.<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>🔹 WHY I BUILT PRAVEEN WORLD</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">I created Praveen World to bring different approaches to personal development and holistic wellbeing together in one place.<br><br>People are not just their goals, careers or achievements.<br><br>There are also:<br><br>Thoughts.<br>Beliefs.<br>Emotions.<br>Learned patterns.<br>Responses.<br>Relationships.<br>Inner experiences.<br><br>Sometimes meaningful change begins by understanding these layers more clearly.<br><br>That is the space I aim to create through my work.<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>🔹 MY APPROACH</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">I don't believe that one approach is right for everyone.<br><br>My work therefore brings together different methods and practices depending on the individual's goals, preferences and the nature of the experience.<br><br><b>🧠 NLP</b><br>Explore thinking, language and behavioural patterns for personal growth, entrepreneurship, leadership and professional development.<br><br><b>🌙 HYPNOTHERAPY</b><br>Use focused attention and guided relaxation to explore inner experiences and learned patterns.<br>A space for deeper awareness, reflection and personal development.<br><br><b>🧲 JAVANESE MAGNETISM</b><br>Explore traditional Javanese magnetism-oriented practices through presence, intention and energetic awareness.<br>Approached as a holistic practice for personal exploration and awareness..<br><br><b>🌀 MESMERISM</b><br>Explore mesmerism in its historical and experiential context through focused attention, presence and suggestion.<br>A traditional approach centred on awareness and experiential exploration.<br><br><b>❤️ EMOTIONAL RELEASE</b><br>Explore emotional experiences and recurring patterns with greater awareness and understanding.<br>Create space for reflection, self-awareness and personal development.<br><br><b>⚡&nbsp;HOLISTIC WELLNESS &amp; ENERGY HEALING</b><br>Explore complementary energy-oriented practices focused on relaxation, grounding and inner balance.<br>A holistic wellness approach supporting awareness and personal wellbeing.<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>🔹 WHO I WORK WITH</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">My work may be relevant for:<br><br><b>Corporate professionals </b>seeking greater awareness, communication and personal effectiveness.<br><b><br>Entrepreneurs &amp; business owners </b>exploring mindset, clarity and professional development.<br><br><b>Students</b> interested in focus, confidence and personal development.<br><br><b>Individuals </b>seeking greater self-awareness, emotional understanding and holistic wellbeing.<br><br><b>Organizations &amp; teams</b> looking for customized NLP-based learning and professional-development experiences.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>🔹 CORPORATE &amp; PROFESSIONAL WORK</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>DEVELOP PEOPLE. STRENGTHEN COMMUNICATION. ENHANCE PERFORMANCE.</b><br><br>Alongside individual work, I offer NLP-based learning experiences for <b>organizations, teams, leaders and professionals.</b><br><br>Programs can explore:<br><br>Leadership &amp; people skills<br>Communication &amp; interpersonal skills<br>Professional confidence &amp; presence<br>Mindset &amp; behavioural awareness<br>Focus &amp; personal effectiveness<br>Team communication &amp; collaboration<br><br>Programs can be customized according to the organization's objectives, audience and format.<br><br><a href=\"programs.html\" class=\"text-primary\"><b>EXPLORE CORPORATE PROGRAMS</b></a></p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>🔹 AS AN AUTHOR &amp; SPEAKER</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">I am also an author and speaker, sharing ideas around personal development, mindset, NLP, human behaviour and inner transformation.<br><br>Through my books, talks and learning experiences, my intention is to make ideas practical, accessible and meaningful for people who want to understand themselves and explore new possibilities.<br><br><a href=\"Library.html\" class=\"text-primary\"><b>VISIT THE LIBRARY</b></a></p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>🔹 MY MISSION</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>TO HELP PEOPLE UNDERSTAND THEMSELVES DEEPLY ENOUGH TO CREATE MEANINGFUL CHANGE.</b><br><br>I believe transformation does not always begin with doing more.<br><br>Sometimes it begins with <b>understanding more.</b><br><br>Understanding how you think.<br>Understanding how you respond.<br>Understanding what you feel.<br>Understanding the patterns you have learned.<br><br>From that awareness, you can begin to make more conscious choices about where you want to go next.<br><br>That is the purpose behind <b>Praveen World.</b></p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>🔹 MY MOTTO</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>“To give the gift of Health, Wealth &amp; Happiness to the world.”</b></p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>🔹 A NOTE FROM PRAVEEN</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>You don't have to have everything figured out before you begin.<br></b><br>You may simply need a space to pause, explore and understand yourself differently.<br><br>Whether your journey begins with <b>NLP • Hypnotherapy • Javanese Magnetism • Mesmerism • Energy Healing • Emotional Release • Holistic Wellness • Personal Development</b>&nbsp;the first step is awareness.<br><br><b>Understand. Explore. Transform.</b></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"programs.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLORE PROGRAMS</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"Library.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">VISIT THE LIBRARY</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://rzp.io/rzp/YZQ6QlB\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">BOOK A  Session!</a></div>\n          </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "article08-ha",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vBxbBpBTa6",
